    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1488">

                <pb facs="0963" n="847" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg847"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.41/105a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent Carothers.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 22, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Urge upon Villa the necessity of delivering the body of Benton to relatives or
                    friends requesting same. The failure to deliver body is being made the basis of
                    speculation and bitter criticism.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
